# study-api (Go)
apps/study-api/study-api
apps/study-api/bin/

# Answers now live INSIDE the question banks (founder directive, 2026-09):
# data/questions/**.json carry `answer`/`explanation` per question and the
# API harvests them at boot, so there is no separate key folder anymore.

# Build-provenance copies of harvested source banks (with answers) are
# kept on disk only — the packed student-safe artifacts live in
# data/questions/. Never commit the raw sources.
data/src/real/
data/src/mock/

# theme-flip golden renders (regenerable via --update-goldens)
apps/mobile/test/goldens/
arena-e2e

# TypeScript incremental build cache
*.tsbuildinfo
